GradedModule -- the class of all graded modules
***********************************************

Description
===========

A new graded module can be made with 'M = new GradedModule'. The i-th module
can be installed with a statement like M#i=N, and can be retrieved with an
expression like M_i.  The ground ring should be installed with a statement like
M.ring = R.

See also
========

  * *note GradedModuleMap: GradedModuleMap, -- the class of all maps between
    graded modules
