* GradedModule ** Module: GradedModule _st_st Module.  a binary operator, usually used for tensor product or Cartesian product
* length(GradedModule): length_lpGradedModule_rp.  length of a graded module
* betti(ChainComplex): betti_lpGradedModule_rp.  Betti diagram showing the of degrees in a graded module or chain complex

