complete(GradedModule)
**********************

  * Function: *note complete: (Macaulay2Doc)complete,

Description
===========

complete C -- completely fills out the chain complex C by calling upon the
engine to provide the maps and modules computed by *note resolution:
resolution,.


This is mainly intended for developers of new routines for chain complexes that
have to make use of their internal structure. Before running this routine, it
is not possible to determine which spots in a chain complex are actually
occupied by modules or maps.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * "complete(ChainComplexMap)"
  * *note complete(GradedModule): complete_lpGradedModule_rp,
