max(GradedModule) -- get the maximum element in a list or sequence
******************************************************************

  * Function: *note max: (Macaulay2Doc)max,
  * Usage: 
        max C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note graded module: GradedModule,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the maximum index of a component,
        possibly zero, of the graded module C

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..e]                                  |
|                                                   |
|o1 = R                                             |
|                                                   |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                |
+---------------------------------------------------+
