ChainComplex ** ChainComplex -- tensor product
**********************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,

Description
===========

C**D -- the tensor product of two chain complexes.


The result, E, is a chain complex.  Each module E_k in it is a direct sum of
modules of the form C_i**D_j with i+j=k, and the preferred keys for the
components of this direct sum are the pairs (i,j), sorted increasing values of
i.  For information about how to use preferred keys, see *note directSum:
(Macaulay2Doc)directSum,.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note ChainComplex ** ChainComplex: ChainComplex _st_st ChainComplex, --
    tensor product
