|                                           |
|     0      1      2      3      4         |
|                                           |
|o7 : ChainComplex                          |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i8 : D^[a]                                 |
|                                           |
|          1               2                |
|o8 = 0 : R  <----------- R  : 0            |
|               | 1 0 |                     |
|                                           |
|          3                           6    |
|     1 : R  <----------------------- R  : 1|
