ChainComplexMap -- the class of all maps between chain complexes
****************************************************************

Description
===========

The usual algebraic operations are available: addition, subtraction, scalar
multiplication, and composition.  The identity map from a chain complex to
itself can be produced with *note id: (Macaulay2Doc)id,.  An attempt to add
(subtract, or compare) a ring element to a chain complex will result in the
ring element being multiplied by the appropriate identity map.
