  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the component D_(i+d) <- C_i

Description
===========

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a..c];                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = image vars R                                             |
|                                                                  |
